{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grab your <u>local friend</u> or use <u>Steam Remote Play</u>, build your robots with unique abilities, and prepare yourself for a shoot-out with evil robotic armies \u2014 All that while receiving both <u>funny </u>and <u>enraging defects</u> in four <u>original episodes</u>. Fall apart but do not fall back!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/enemies.gif?t=1749885049\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/two_robot_buddies.png?t=1749885049\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crawlbot and Jetbot are different in terms of playstyle and <strong>customization options</strong>, but they complement each other. Despite being made from <strong>low-quality materials</strong>, and prone to <strong>malfunctions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/two_robot_buddies.gif?t=1749885049\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/build_them_up.png?t=1749885049\" />Assemble unique robots from various <strong>defects and bonuses</strong>. Build a <strong>powerful but unstable</strong> robot or play it safe. Get more movement directions, active reload ability, power-ups, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/buildingscreen_1.gif?t=1749885049\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/watch_them_break_apart.png?t=1749885049\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All bonuses need to be balanced out with faulty parts in a <strong>unique &quot;High risk - High reward&quot; customization</strong>. Can you turn the malfunctions into an advantage? Be prepared for  <strong>friendly fire</strong>, <strong>nonstop</strong> <strong>movement</strong>, or <strong>extra-thick smoke</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/defekty-spole\u010dn\u011b-final.gif?t=1749885049\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/hand-drawn_graphics.png?t=1749885049\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through <strong>four episodes</strong>, each consisting of multiple missions designed to be <strong>played in one sitting</strong>, forming a short story. In every one of them, you meet different enemies, <strong>enjoy new mechanics,</strong> and experience various beautiful environments, all created and animated <strong>by hand</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/SCSteamGIfSteam600x280.gif?t=1749885049\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/metal_sound.png?t=1749885049\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tiny, tinny mosh pit moves to the sound of the <strong>brass-heavy adaptive soundtrack</strong>. But you will be able to hum with our robots at the campfire too. Throw yourself to the tune of <strong>tubas, trombones, trumpets, and horns</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/t\u00e1bor\u00e1k_v2_bez_textu.gif?t=1749885049\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/comedic_totality.png?t=1749885049\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have chosen the most boring topic - bureaucracy -, added robots, and took it to an <strong>absurd extreme</strong>. But most fun still comes from <strong>your gameplay</strong>! Enemies stop at nothing. Except for the lunch break, there is <strong>no way</strong> they are going to miss that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/comedictotalitygif.gif?t=1749885049\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BECOME A SILICOMRADE AND HELP SAVE INNOCENT LOW-COST ROBOTS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/z\u00e1v\u011bre\u010dn\u00fd_gif-edit-final.gif?t=1749885049\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1172930?t=1749885049","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749885049","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749885049","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749885049","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descri