src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/comedic_totality.png?t=1749885049\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have chosen the most boring topic - bureaucracy -, added robots, and took it to an <strong>absurd extreme</strong>. But most fun still comes from <strong>your gameplay</strong>! Enemies stop at nothing. Except for the lunch break, there is <strong>no way</strong> they are going to miss that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/comedictotalitygif.gif?t=1749885049\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BECOME A SILICOMRADE AND HELP SAVE INNOCENT LOW-COST ROBOTS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/z\u00e1v\u011bre\u010dn\u00fd_gif-edit-final.gif?t=1749885049\" /></p>","developers":["Outside the Fox"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/header.jpg?t=1749885049","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E6320 (2*1866) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 7600 GS (512 MB) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS 10.6+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154310,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154310/movie480.mp4?t=1749885047","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.co